  "name": {
   "zh": "深度与摄影机 · VGGT",
   "en": "Depth and Camera · VGGT"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "VGGT 官方自述：前馈网络，从一张、几张到数百张画面，几秒内推断出摄影机内外参、点图、深度贴图和 3D 跟踪点。这张卡交付每帧摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机）、深度贴图和点云；点云是每帧一张点图、各在这一帧自己的摄影机里，官方没有合成一份场景点云的输出。默认的「原版」权重非商用；商用请把「模型」换成「商用版」。",
   "en": "VGGT is a feed-forward network that infers camera intrinsics and extrinsics, pointmaps, depth maps and 3D tracks from one to hundreds of images in seconds. This card delivers per-frame cameras (USD and Nuke camera), depth maps and point clouds, one pointmap per frame in that frame's own camera. The default original weights are non-commercial; for commercial use set Model to the commercial version."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_camera",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
